  "_about": "Every path the v9 build (www/) writes for the production base `/`, emitted by www/scripts/postbuild.mjs on every build and drift-checked by scripts/check_www_build.py. deploy/sync_site_to_s3.sh and deploy/rollback_site.sh exclude exactly these through deploy/www_owned_paths.py — one owner per path (#5534). `live_at_root` is the cut-over switch, not build output: false = the build is served at /next/v9/ only; true = the build owns `/` and every `www/**` merge deploys there.",
